  folklore: "Ta l\xE0 qu\u1EF7 c\u1EA9u \u2014 con ch\xF3 h\xF3a tinh ho\u1EB7c y\xEAu
    khuy\u1EC3n b\xE1o \u0111i\u1EC1m d\u1EEF. Ti\u1EBFng h\xFA c\u1EE7a ta gi\u1EEFa
    \u0111\xEAm v\xE0 b\xF3ng ch\xF3 l\u1EA1 quanh m\xE1i nh\xE0 khi\u1EBFn d\xE2n
    gian tin tai h\u1ECDa \u0111ang \u0111\u1EBFn g\u1EA7n."
